EldoUI_Emoji
============

This folder is generated by tools/emoji/gen_emoji.py (EldoUI's own code,
Copyright 2026 Eldodeldo, Apache-2.0) from two openly licensed sources.

Graphics: Sheets/*.tga
----------------------
Twemoji, https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji, tag v17.0.3
(commit b6b55fef1e8636b540a6d016a4729ca8cdf2e60b).
Copyright (c) 2014-2021 Twitter, Inc and other contributors.
Copyright (c) 2022-present Jason Sofonia & Justine De Caires (jdecked fork)
and other contributors.
Licensed under CC-BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: the 72x72 PNG files were scaled down to 32x32 and packed into
1024x1024 TGA atlas sheets. No other changes.

